# TOEIC import & related

## Paste import (primary)

- Endpoint: `POST /import/toeic-vocab` (`api_import.py`)
- Pipeline: preprocess (`toeic_preprocess.py` + `data/toeic_*.txt`) → spaCy lemma (`toeic_lemma.py`) → chunked OpenRouter extraction → card-ready terms
- Model: `OPENROUTER_MODEL_IMPORT` or fallback to hint model; respect timeout clamps
- POS must stay within `card_helpers.POS_WHITELIST`

## Frontend

- UI: `web/nuxt/pages/import/toeic-text.vue` — paste text, call import API, then typically batch-add into a deck via decks API

## Tag suggest

- `POST /tags/suggest` uses OpenRouter (`tag_suggest.py`); model falls back to hint when `OPENROUTER_MODEL_TAG` empty

## Chrome extension

- `localExtension/` MV3 scanner reads page DOM for candidate vocab
- Standalone; not part of Nuxt build — do not assume it posts to the API unless you add that wiring

## Careful

- Large pastes are chunked; keep caps (`TOEIC_MAX_*`) unless product requires change
- Do not commit API keys; import is no-op/errors without OpenRouter when AI is required
